      "parameters": {
        "content": "AI Lead Qualification & Automated Sales Routing\n\nBuilt a production-style n8n automation that uses Google Gemini to classify incoming leads, generate structured customer data, route leads to the appropriate salesperson, and automatically generate internal follow-up emails. Integrated Slack notifications for sales visibility and implemented a separate reusable error-handling workflow that logs failures to Google Sheets and alerts the team through Slack/Telegram.",
